{"matched":9,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1590_p0074c01","n":"0074c","t":"瞖見髮蠅等此中都無少分實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1590_p0075a01","n":"0075a","t":"一切如地獄同見獄卒等能為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1590_p0075b01","n":"0075b","t":"種復次頌曰業熏習餘處執餘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1590_p0075c01","n":"0075c","t":"入有情無我復依此餘說唯識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1590_p0076a01","n":"0076a","t":"分一處無容有餘處故一極微"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1590_p0076b01","n":"0076b","t":"何失二俱有過多過如前一亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1590_p0076c01","n":"0076c","t":"論曰如前所說雖無外境而眼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1590_p0077a01","n":"0077a","t":"如鬼等意力令他失念等論曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1590_p0077b01","n":"0077b","t":"誰能具廣決擇頌曰我已隨自"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T31n1590-唯識二十論","source":"CBETA T31n1590 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":9,"unit":"T31 頁欄"}